              "settings": {
                "html": "<!--\n  Elementor HTML widget version.\n  Upload the \"assets\" folder to your WordPress site and replace every\n  \"assets/\" path below with the public URL where the folder lives, if needed.\n-->\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<div class=\"wi-elementor-layout\">\n  <header class=\"wi-header\">\n    <div class=\"wi-data-banner\"></div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"wi-hero\" id=\"inicio\">\n      <div class=\"wi-inner\">\n        <img class=\"wi-hero-logo wi-reveal wi-top\" src=\"assets/original/asasaAgrupar-5-copiar-blue.png\" alt=\"World Invest\">\n        <h1 class=\"wi-reveal wi-top\">100% GRATIS! CON CUPOS LIMITADOS! USTED NUNCA ESCUCH&Oacute; UNA PROPUESTA COMO ESTA.</h1>\n        <p class=\"wi-reveal wi-top\">Descubra en pocos minutos una oportunidad &uacute;nica que puede cambiar su forma de pensar y actuar hoy.</p>\n        <a class=\"wi-cta wi-reveal wi-bottom\" href=\"https://t.me/+gXy5dvqSguY0Nzgx\">QUIERO ASEGURAR MI CUPO <span>&#8599;</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"wi-middle\">\n      <div class=\"wi-line-row\">\n        <div class=\"wi-double-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"wi-line wi-reveal-line\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"wi-copy-card wi-reveal wi-bottom\">\n        <img class=\"wi-card-logo\" src=\"assets/original/asasaAgrupar-5-copiar-blue.png\" alt=\"World Invest\">\n        <h2>No se trata de aprender a analizar gr&aacute;ficos. Se trata de usar una herramienta que copia por usted.</h2>\n        <p>Si yo le dijera que existe una forma de obtener resultados en el mercado financiero sin hacer nada, &iquest;usted lo creer&iacute;a? &iquest;Y si le dijera que solo paga despu&eacute;s de que el dinero entra en su cuenta?</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"wi-summary\" id=\"cupo\">\n      <div class=\"wi-summary-head wi-reveal wi-top\">\n        <h2>Es decir:</h2>\n        <div class=\"wi-summary-line wi-reveal-line\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"wi-badges\">\n        <span class=\"wi-reveal wi-bottom\">&#9989; Sin riesgo</span>\n        <span class=\"wi-reveal wi-bottom\">&#9989; Sin promesas vac&iacute;as</span>\n        <span class=\"wi-reveal wi-bottom\">&#9989; Sin pagar anticipado</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"wi-final-text wi-reveal wi-bottom\">Usted no necesita aprender. Solo necesita dejar que la herramienta copie a quien ya sabe lo que est&aacute; haciendo.</h2>\n      <a class=\"wi-cta wi-reveal wi-bottom\" href=\"https://t.me/+gXy5dvqSguY0Nzgx\">QUIERO ASEGURAR MI CUPO <span>&#8599;</span></a>\n      <div class=\"wi-footer-line\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"wi-footer\">\n    <p>Las inversiones implican riesgos y pueden causar p&eacute;rdidas al inversor. Verifique los riesgos y si la inversi&oacute;n tiene sentido para su perfil antes de invertir. No hay garant&iacute;a de retorno. Resultados pasados no garantizan resultados futuros.</p>\n    <strong>WORLD INVEST - TODOS LOS DERECHOS RESERVADOS</strong>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .wi-elementor-layout,\n  .wi-elementor-layout * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .wi-elementor-layout {\n    --wi-content-width: 1280px;\n    --wi-mobile-width: 300px;\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    background: #000c14;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Rubik\", sans-serif;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n\n  .wi-elementor-layout a {\n    color: inherit;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .wi-header {\n    height: 80px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #122b3c;\n    background: #00070c;\n  }\n\n  .wi-data-banner {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .wi-hero {\n    min-height: 650px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #174865;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 12, 20, 1) 0%, rgba(0, 12, 20, .96) 31%, rgba(0, 12, 20, .34) 65%, rgba(0, 12, 20, .08) 100%),\n      linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0, 12, 20, .18), rgba(0, 12, 20, .18)),\n      url(\"assets/hero-generated.png\") right center / cover no-repeat;\n  }\n\n  .wi-inner {\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-left: 40px;\n    padding-right: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-hero-logo {\n    width: 20%;\n    max-width: 256px;\n    margin-bottom: 21px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-hero h1 {\n    width: 52%;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.08;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-hero p {\n    width: 38%;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: -.7px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-cta {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 415px;\n    height: 65px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 300px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #c6efff;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #c6efff;\n    background: linear-gradient(72deg, #0b72d9 2.3%, #5bd2ff 54.62%, #063f95 103.81%);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    animation: wiCtaPulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n    transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .wi-cta::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: -75%;\n    width: 50%;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255,255,255,.1), rgba(255,255,255,.55), rgba(255,255,255,.1));\n    transform: skewX(-20deg);\n  }\n\n  .wi-cta:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-3px);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15);\n  }\n\n  .wi-cta:hover::before {\n    animation: wiShine 1.2s ease forwards;\n  }\n\n  .wi-middle {\n    min-height: 1054px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,12,20,.1), #000c14 92%),\n      url(\"assets/original/bgSlice-2.webp\") top center / cover no-repeat;\n  }\n\n  .wi-line-row {\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 530px;\n    margin: 0 auto 30px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-double-circle {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 86px;\n    height: 54px;\n    flex: 0 0 86px;\n    animation: wiFloatMark 3.4s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n\n  .wi-double-circle::before,\n  .wi-double-circle::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    width: 54px;\n    height: 54px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .wi-double-circle::before {\n    right: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .wi-double-circle::after {\n    left: 0;\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    background: #32bcff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(50,188,255,0);\n    animation: wiCircleGlow 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n\n  .wi-line,\n  .wi-summary-line,\n  .wi-footer-line {\n    height: 5px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 0 46%, #32bcff 46% 100%);\n  }\n\n  .wi-line {\n    flex: 1;\n    max-width: 630px;\n    transform-origin: left center;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card {\n    position: relative;\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    min-height: 788px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-left: 90px;\n    border: 1px solid #063354;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    background: #000d15;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card::before,\n  .wi-copy-card::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card::before {\n    z-index: 0;\n    background: url(\"assets/original/ksks-blue.webp\") top center / cover no-repeat;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card::after {\n    z-index: 1;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,13,21,.99) 0%, rgba(0,13,21,.82) 43%, rgba(0,13,21,.12) 100%);\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card > * {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  .wi-card-logo {\n    width: 20%;\n    max-width: 256px;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card h2 {\n    width: 41%;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-copy-card p {\n    width: 34%;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    letter-spacing: -.7px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-summary {\n    min-height: 574px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    padding: 126px 40px 96px;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n\n  .wi-summary-head {\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .wi-summary-head h2 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-summary-line {\n    width: 630px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0;\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    margin: 24px auto 18px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges span {\n    width: 33.333%;\n    max-width: 413px;\n    height: 54px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-left: -1px;\n    border: 1px solid #777;\n    border-radius: 200px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    transition: transform .3s ease, border-color .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges span:first-child {\n    margin-left: 0;\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges span:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-4px);\n    border-color: #32bcff;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(50,188,255,.12);\n  }\n\n  .wi-final-text {\n    width: min(1070px, 79%);\n    margin: 0 auto 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.14;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-summary .wi-cta {\n    margin: 0 auto 40px;\n  }\n\n  .wi-footer-line {\n    width: min(var(--wi-content-width), 100%);\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #32bcff 0 26.7%, #fcf8ed 26.7% 100%);\n  }\n\n  .wi-footer {\n    min-height: 70px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    padding: 8px 20px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #fcf8ed;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .wi-footer p {\n    max-width: 1180px;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .wi-footer strong {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal {\n    opacity: 0;\n    filter: blur(10px);\n    transition: opacity .65s ease, filter .65s ease, transform .65s ease;\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal.wi-top {\n    transform: translate3d(0, -30px, 0);\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal.wi-bottom {\n    transform: translate3d(0, 30px, 0);\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal.wi-active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    filter: blur(0);\n    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal-line {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scaleX(0);\n    transition: opacity .5s ease, transform .9s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);\n  }\n\n  .wi-reveal-line.wi-active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scaleX(1);\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges span:nth-child(2) {\n    transition-delay: .08s;\n  }\n\n  .wi-badges span:nth-child(3) {\n    transition-delay: .16s;\n  }\n\n  @keyframes wiShine {\n    from { left: -75%; }\n    to { left: 130%; }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes wiCtaPulse {\n    0%,\n    100% {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(50,188,255,0);\n    }\n\n    50% {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(50,188,255,.24);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes wiFloatMark {\n    0%,\n    100% {\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n\n    50% {\n      transform: translateY(-4px);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes wiCircleGlow {\n    0%,\n    100% {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(50,188,255,0);\n    }\n\n    50% {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(50,188,255,.34);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .wi-header {\n      height: 80px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-data-banner {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-hero {\n      min-height: 690px;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      padding-bottom: 40px;\n      text-align: center;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 12, 20, .02) 0%, rgba(0, 12, 20, .2) 44%, rgba(0, 12, 20, .94) 70%, #000c14 100%),\n        url(\"assets/hero-person-mobile.png\") center top / cover no-repeat;\n    }\n\n    .wi-inner {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-hero-logo {\n      width: 42%;\n      max-width: 130px;\n      margin: 0 auto 15px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-hero h1 {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      margin: 0 auto 20px;\n      font-size: 27px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-hero p {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      margin: 0 auto 20px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n\n    .wi-cta {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      height: 45px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-middle {\n      min-height: 938px;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .wi-line-row {\n      gap: 15px;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .wi-double-circle {\n      width: 61px;\n      height: 43px;\n      flex-basis: 61px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-double-circle::before,\n    .wi-double-circle::after {\n      width: 39px;\n      height: 39px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-double-circle::after {\n      border-width: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-line {\n      height: 2.6px;\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      max-width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n    }\n\n    .wi-copy-card {\n      min-height: 813px;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      padding: 0 0 40px;\n      border-radius: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .wi-copy-card::before {\n      background-image: url(\"assets/original/asaGroup-36-blue.webp\");\n    }\n\n    .wi-copy-card::after {\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,13,21,.06) 0%, rgba(0,13,21,.82) 55%, #000d15 100%);\n    }\n\n    .wi-card-logo {\n      width: 160px;\n      max-width: 160px;\n      margin: 0 auto 20px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-copy-card h2,\n    .wi-copy-card p {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      margin-left: auto;\n      margin-right: auto;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .wi-summary {\n      min-height: 596px;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-summary-head {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .wi-summary-head h2 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-summary-line {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      height: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-badges {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .wi-badges span {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      max-width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      margin-left: 0;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-final-text {\n      width: var(--wi-mobile-width);\n      font-size: 25px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n\n    .wi-footer-line {\n      height: 1.2px;\n    }\n\n    .wi-footer p,\n    .wi-footer strong {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (() => {\n    const root = document.currentScript.closest(\".elementor-widget-container\")?.querySelector(\".wi-elementor-layout\")\n      || document.querySelector(\".wi-elementor-layout\");\n\n    if (!root) {\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const revealItems = root.querySelectorAll(\".wi-reveal, .wi-reveal-line\");\n    const days = [\"DOMINGO\", \"LUNES\", \"MARTES\", \"MIERCOLES\", \"JUEVES\", \"VIERNES\", \"SABADO\"];\n    const months = [\"ENERO\", \"FEBRERO\", \"MARZO\", \"ABRIL\", \"MAYO\", \"JUNIO\", \"JULIO\", \"AGOSTO\", \"SEPTIEMBRE\", \"OCTUBRE\", \"NOVIEMBRE\", \"DICIEMBRE\"];\n    const today = new Date();\n    const banner = root.querySelector(\".wi-data-banner\");\n\n    if (banner) {\n      const dayName = days[today.getDay()];\n      const day = String(today.getDate()).padStart(2, \"0\");\n      const month = months[today.getMonth()];\n      const year = today.getFullYear();\n      banner.innerText = `HOY, ${dayName}, ${day} DE ${month} DE ${year} ESTAMOS FINALIZANDO LOS CUPOS 100% GRATUITOS`;\n    }\n\n    if (\"IntersectionObserver\" in window) {\n      const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(\n        (entries) => {\n          entries.forEach((entry) => {\n            if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n              entry.target.classList.add(\"wi-active\");\n            }\n          });\n        },\n        { threshold: 0.2 }\n      );\n\n      revealItems.forEach((item) => revealObserver.observe(item));\n    } else {\n      revealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add(\"wi-active\"));\n    }\n  })();\n</script>\n"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
